  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.<br>• Cut sweet potato and zucchini into <br>bite-sized chunks.<br>• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive <br>oil and season with a pinch of salt and pepper.<br>• Toss to coat, then bake until tender, 20-25 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689be30b06d399ea41bc00d0/step-95da2300.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While the veggies are roasting, finely chop brown<br>onion. Drain and rinse chickpeas. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689be30b06d399ea41bc00d0/step-cab64e10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When the veggies have 10 minutes left, heat a large <br>frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook onion, <br>tossing, until softened, 4-5 minutes.<br>• Add chickpeas, diced tomatoes with garlic &amp; <br>onion, the brown sugar and a splash of water and <br>cook until slightly thickened, 4-5 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689be30b06d399ea41bc00d0/step-8baa9220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• To the chickpeas, add basil pesto, roasted veggies <br>and baby spinach leaves. Stir to combine. Season <br>to taste and cover to keep warm. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689be30b06d399ea41bc00d0/step-4e085c30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a medium saucepan, combine the water, milk<br>and salt and bring to the boil over high heat. <br>• Reduce heat to medium and slowly whisk in instant<br>polenta, then cook, stirring, until smooth and <br>thickened, 2-3 minutes. <br>• Remove from the heat, then add the butter, half of <br>the Parmesan cheese and a good pinch of salt<br>and pepper. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689be30b06d399ea41bc00d0/step-7d0be640.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide creamy polenta between bowls, then <br>top with pesto chickpea and veggie stew.<br>• Sprinkle with remaining Parmesan cheese and <br>pine nuts.<br>• Tear over parsley to serve. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689be30b06d399ea41bc00d0/step-84330c50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
